vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h932LMdhtAsQ7kNvwH-ASxG&_nc_oc=Adn1XKhFemMoIq8b5emVdr7nShLg4q9GD6G8rvTBCLhFlDJw2mKIFkmf_GQS9_trJBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxX9Gu5sy-Ns8X0pvNVFW0fE7k6swoi8KbbM3M9UNvZdw&oe=69B16854"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NREJlKMTUyYQ7kNvwFX3pnm&_nc_oc=AdlXqEKoG1eSJA-1uSkVaLRegrDEAZabynlF09MafyrlXLljbaa-xXdnfEpmW9So0ck&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzbiuXhqKfCFW-1OtTcQOCCKuc_6NMTbsXLmvyBW6KUrQ&oe=69B16D32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rdwMh-8JdqoQ7kNvwEIJY2C&_nc_oc=Admltg9ADN7hivzgdKkOFg5gXLKi2EschEKCu9rmgZ2eVqiV-ft_P5d_WHkWX1FD6zY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzzzJ-gljQKqFvlH_i8jfdI_4nbsB_r6wBZ9XVmmViGEg&oe=69B17AD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "